{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>港股今日大跌，失守兩萬三，就連防守性較高的高息股亦跟跌。股評人李明德表示，這類股份已經跌得較重磅股少，相信資金將會避險至內銀股。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T06:41:48.209534+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":64,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T05:39:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T08:17:56.922743+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:37:53.635569+00:00","content_hash":"f80e94700671bd0e92439f079a343ab0d73f0945650e1ec17b7372849c1b2eb6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}